[Term]
id: PROMOT:0010024
name: Intermediate young adulthood
def: "Age category including people between 19 and 24 years old (inclusive)." [] {IAO:0000119="HP:0025709"}
is_a: PROMOT:0010022 ! Young adulthood
property_value: IAO:0000117 "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-5160-7927" xsd:string
property_value: seeAlso HP:0025709

[Term]
id: PROMOT:0010025
name: Late young adulthood
def: "Age category including people between 25 and 39 years old (inclusive)." [] {IAO:0000119="HP:0025710"}
comment: This term includes the full 19th year of age up to the completed 25th year of age (i.e., less than the 25th birthday). [from: HP:0025709]
is_a: PROMOT:0010022 ! Young adulthood
property_value: IAO:0000117 "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-5160-7927" xsd:string
property_value: seeAlso HP:0025710

[Term]
id: PROMOT:0010026
name: Antenatal age
def: "Age category prior to birth." [] {IAO:0000119="HP:0025710"}
comment: This term includes the full 25th year of age up to the completed 40th year of age (i.e., less than the 40th birthday). [from: HP:0025710]
is_a: PROMOT:0010018 ! Age Category
property_value: IAO:0000117 "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-5160-7927" xsd:string
property_value: seeAlso HP:0025710

[Term]
id: PROMOT:0010027
name: Embryonal
def: "Age category up to 8 weeks following fertilization, corresponding to 10 weeks of gestation (inclusive)." [] {IAO:0000119="HP:0011460"}
is_a: PROMOT:0010026 ! Antenatal age
property_value: IAO:0000117 "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-5160-7927" xsd:string
property_value: seeAlso HP:0011460

[Term]
id: PROMOT:0010028
name: Fetal
def: "Age prior to birth but after 8 weeks of embryonic development (corresponding to a gestational age of 10 weeks)." [] {IAO:0000119="HP:0011461"}
comment: [EURO-NMD] Atalia A et al., EURO-NMD registry: federated FAIR infrastructure, innovative technologies and concepts of a patient-centred registry for rare neuromuscular disorders. Orphanet J Rare Dis. 2024 Feb 14;19(1):66. doi: 10.1186/s13023-024-03059-3. PMID: 38355534; PMCID: PMC10865673.
xref: http://snomed.info/id/303112003
is_a: PROMOT:0010026 ! Antenatal age
property_value: IAO:0000117 "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-5160-7927" xsd:string
property_value: seeAlso HP:0011461

[Term]
id: PROMOT:0010029
name: Late first trimester
def: "Category prior to birth in the first trimester during the early fetal period, which is defined as 11 to 13 weeks of gestation (inclusive)." [] {IAO:0000119="HP:0034199"}
is_a: PROMOT:0010028 ! Fetal
property_value: IAO:0000117 "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-5160-7927" xsd:string
property_value: seeAlso HP:0034199

[Term]
id: PROMOT:0010030
name: Second trimester
def: "Category prior to birth during the second trimester, which comprises the range of gestational ages from 14 to 27 weeks of gestation (inclusive)." [] {IAO:0000119="HP:0034198"}
is_a: PROMOT:0010028 ! Fetal
property_value: IAO:0000117 "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-5160-7927" xsd:string
property_value: seeAlso HP:0034198

[Term]
